#: ../../source/declarative.rst:2
msgid "Declarative UI Guide"
msgstr "声明式开发指南"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:4
msgid ""
"This guide covers building applications on the **declarative track** "
"(``fluxent.decl``) using ``flux_run`` and the element builders in "
"``<xtk/xtk.h>``."
msgstr ""
"本指南介绍如何基于 **声明式路线** （ ``fluxent.decl`` ），使用 ``flux_run`` 与 ``<xtk/xtk.h>`` "
"中的元素构建器开发应用程序。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:9
msgid "First Step: Understand the Elm MVU Architecture"
msgstr "第一步：理解 Elm 的 MVU 架构"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:11
msgid ""
"Declarative Xent organizes every application around the "
"**Model–View–Update (MVU)** unidirectional loop (from the Elm "
"Architecture):"
msgstr ""
"Xent 声明式层围绕源于 Elm 架构的 **Model–View–Update（MVU）** 单向数据流循环组织整个应用："

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Model**: A plain C ``struct`` holding your application state in one "
"place (for example ``int n;`` for a counter)."
msgstr "**Model（状态模型）** ：一个普通的 C ``struct`` ，集中保存应用的全部状态（例如计数器中的 ``int n;`` ）。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:30
msgid ""
"**View** (``view(ui, model)``): A pure description function that reads "
"the current ``Model`` and returns an ``XtkEl *`` tree describing the "
"window contents. Interactive controls emit integer-tagged message values "
"(such as ``xtk_msg(MSG_INC)``) when triggered."
msgstr ""
"**View（视图函数** ``view(ui, model)`` **）** ：读取当前 ``Model`` 并返回描述窗口界面的 ``XtkEl *`` "
"元素树。交互控件在被触发时发出带整数标签的消息值（例如 ``xtk_msg(MSG_INC)`` ）。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Update** (``update(model, msg)``): The single function where "
"application state changes. When the user interacts with a control, the "
"host posts its ``XtkMsg``, and ``update`` switches on ``msg.tag`` to "
"update the ``Model`` struct in place."
msgstr ""
"**Update（更新函数** ``update(model, msg)`` **）** ：状态变更的唯一入口。用户操作控件后，宿主投递对应的 "
"``XtkMsg`` ， ``update`` 根据 ``msg.tag`` 就地修改 ``Model`` 结构体。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Reconcile & Commit**: After draining pending messages for the frame, "
"``flux_run`` calls ``view`` again, diffs the new ``XtkEl *`` tree against"
" the live retained controls, and commits the minimal changes in one "
"atomic ``XtkBatch``."
msgstr ""
"**协调与提交（Reconcile & Commit）** ：处理完当前帧排队的全部消息后， ``flux_run`` 重新调用 ``view`` ，"
"将新的 ``XtkEl *`` 树与窗口中现有的保留式控件做差异比对，并在单个原子 ``XtkBatch`` 中提交最小变更。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:44
msgid "Anatomy of the ``fluxent.decl`` Template"
msgstr "``fluxent.decl`` 模板代码解析"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:46
msgid ""
"Running ``xmake create -l c -t fluxent.decl hello`` generates a complete "
"MVU counter in ``src/main.c``:"
msgstr "执行 ``xmake create -l c -t fluxent.decl hello`` 会在 ``src/main.c`` 中生成完整的 MVU 计数器示例："

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:112
msgid "Key Details"
msgstr "核心要点"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:114
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Message tags (** ``enum`` **)**: Start message enums at ``1`` so tag "
"``0`` stays reserved for inert zero-initialized descriptors (``.click = "
"{0}``). Use ``xtk_msg(MSG_INC)`` for a plain tag, or ``xtk_msg_i(tag, "
"index)`` to attach an ``int32_t`` parameter in ``msg.i``."
msgstr ""
"**消息标签（** ``enum`` **）** ：消息枚举从 ``1`` 开始编号，将 ``0`` 留给零初始化的空描述字段"
"（ ``.click = {0}`` ）。普通标签使用 ``xtk_msg(MSG_INC)`` 构造；需要附带 ``int32_t`` 参数时使用 "
"``xtk_msg_i(tag, index)`` （在 ``msg.i`` 中读取）。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:118
msgid ""
"**Control registration**: Register the control modules your app uses "
"before calling ``flux_run``—selectively with "
"``flux_controls_use(&flux_ctrl_<name>)`` for minimal binary size, or all "
"at once with ``flux_controls_all()`` while prototyping."
msgstr ""
"**注册控件模块** ：在调用 ``flux_run`` 前注册程序用到的控件模块——按需调用 "
"``flux_controls_use(&flux_ctrl_<name>)`` 可获得最小的可执行文件体积；快速原型开发时也可调用 "
"``flux_controls_all()`` 一次性注册全部内置控件。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:122
msgid ""
"**Window entry point**: GUI-subsystem builds enter via ``WinMain`` and "
"configure the window title as a wide string ``L\"...\"`` on "
"``FluxAppCfg``."
msgstr ""
"**窗口入口函数** ：启用 Windows GUI 子系统的工程以 ``WinMain`` 作为入口，并在 ``FluxAppCfg`` 中使用宽字符串 "
"``L\"...\"`` 设置窗口标题。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:126
msgid "Layout Containers, Children, and Modifiers"
msgstr "布局容器、子元素列表与修饰器"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:128
msgid ""
"Container builders arrange children with ``xent-core``'s Flex layout "
"engine:"
msgstr "容器构建器使用 ``xent-core`` 的 Flex 布局引擎排列子元素："

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:130
msgid "``xtk_column(ui, desc, children)`` — Vertical stack (top to bottom)."
msgstr "``xtk_column(ui, desc, children)`` —— 纵向排列容器（自上而下）。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:131
msgid "``xtk_row(ui, desc, children)`` — Horizontal stack (left to right)."
msgstr "``xtk_row(ui, desc, children)`` —— 横向排列容器（自左向右）。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:132
msgid "``xtk_card(ui, desc, children)`` — Styled Fluent card container."
msgstr "``xtk_card(ui, desc, children)`` —— 带 Fluent 表面样式的卡片容器。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:133
msgid "``xtk_scroll(ui, scroll_desc, children)`` — Scrollable viewport."
msgstr "``xtk_scroll(ui, scroll_desc, children)`` —— 可滚动视口容器。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:135
msgid "Common ``XtkStackDesc`` fields:"
msgstr "``XtkStackDesc`` 常用字段："

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:137
msgid "``.gap`` — Spacing in logical pixels between adjacent children."
msgstr "``.gap`` —— 相邻子元素之间的逻辑像素间距。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:138
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``.padding = {left, top, right, bottom}`` — Inner insets (``XentInsets``)."
msgstr "``.padding = {left, top, right, bottom}`` —— 容器四边内边距（ ``XentInsets`` ，顺序为左、上、右、下）。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:139
msgid ""
"``.align`` — Cross-axis alignment (``XENT_FLEX_ALIGN_START``, "
"``XENT_FLEX_ALIGN_CENTER``, ``XENT_FLEX_ALIGN_STRETCH``)."
msgstr ""
"``.align`` —— 交叉轴对齐方式（ ``XENT_FLEX_ALIGN_START`` 、 ``XENT_FLEX_ALIGN_CENTER`` 、 "
"``XENT_FLEX_ALIGN_STRETCH`` ）。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:141
msgid ""
"``.justify`` — Main-axis distribution; ``.wrap = XENT_FLEX_WRAP`` enables"
" multi-line wrapping."
msgstr "``.justify`` —— 主轴分布方式；设置 ``.wrap = XENT_FLEX_WRAP`` 可启用自动换行。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:145
msgid "Passing Children with ``xtk_kids``"
msgstr "使用 ``xtk_kids`` 传入子元素"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:147
msgid ""
"Containers accept an ``XTK_END``-terminated array of ``XtkEl *`` "
"pointers. Wrap inline child lists with ``xtk_kids(...)``, which appends "
"the ``XTK_END`` sentinel automatically:"
msgstr ""
"容器接收以 ``XTK_END`` 结尾的 ``XtkEl *`` 指针数组。编写内联子元素时使用 ``xtk_kids(...)`` 宏包裹，"
"它会自动在末尾补上 ``XTK_END`` 结束标记："

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:159
msgid ""
"When constructing a dynamic child list in a loop, allocate ``count + 1`` "
"slots with ``xtk_children_alloc(ui, count + 1)`` and set slot ``count`` "
"to ``XTK_END``."
msgstr ""
"在循环中动态构建子元素数组时，调用 ``xtk_children_alloc(ui, count + 1)`` 从当前帧内存池分配 ``count + 1`` "
"个槽位，并将第 ``count`` 个槽位设为 ``XTK_END`` 。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:164
msgid "Layout Modifiers"
msgstr "布局修饰器"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:166
msgid ""
"Wrap any ``XtkEl *`` with modifier functions to configure its layout "
"behavior:"
msgstr "使用修饰器函数包裹任意 ``XtkEl *`` 以调整其在父容器中的布局行为："

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:168
msgid ""
"``xtk_sized(el, width, height)`` — Set explicit width and/or height; pass"
" ``NAN`` (from ``<math.h>``) on an axis that sizes to content."
msgstr ""
"``xtk_sized(el, width, height)`` —— 指定固定宽度或高度；按内容自适应的轴向传入 ``<math.h>`` 中的 ``NAN`` 。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:170
msgid ""
"``xtk_grow(el, factor)`` — Expand along the parent stack's main axis (for"
" example ``xtk_grow(el, 1.0f)`` to fill remaining space)."
msgstr ""
"``xtk_grow(el, factor)`` —— 沿父容器主轴按比例伸展（例如用 ``xtk_grow(el, 1.0f)`` 占满剩余空间）。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:172
msgid ""
"``xtk_align(el, XENT_FLEX_ALIGN_...)`` — Set cross-axis alignment for a "
"single child."
msgstr "``xtk_align(el, XENT_FLEX_ALIGN_...)`` —— 单独设置某个子元素的交叉轴对齐方式。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:174
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``xtk_margin(el, (XentInsets) {left, top, right, bottom})`` — Add outer "
"margins."
msgstr "``xtk_margin(el, (XentInsets) {left, top, right, bottom})`` —— 设置四边外边距。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:176
msgid ""
"``xtk_tooltip(ui, el, \"Hint\")`` — Attach a hover and keyboard-focus "
"tooltip."
msgstr "``xtk_tooltip(ui, el, \"Hint\")`` —— 为元素附加鼠标悬停与键盘焦点提示框。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:179
msgid "Formatting Dynamic Strings"
msgstr "格式化动态字符串"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:181
msgid ""
"The reconciler reads strings from the element tree after ``view()`` "
"returns, so allocate dynamic per-frame text in ``XtkUi *``'s scratch "
"arena:"
msgstr "协调器会在 ``view()`` 返回之后读取元素树中的字符串，因此每帧动态拼接的文本应分配在 ``XtkUi *`` 的帧内存池中："

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:184
#, python-format
msgid ""
"``xtk_fmt(ui, \"Value: %d\", m->n)`` — Formats text with ``printf`` "
"syntax into the frame arena and reclaims it automatically after commit."
msgstr ""
"``xtk_fmt(ui, \"Value: %d\", m->n)`` —— 按 ``printf`` 语法将字符串格式化到当前帧内存池中，并在提交后自动回收。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:186
msgid "``xtk_strdup(ui, str)`` — Copies a temporary string into the frame arena."
msgstr "``xtk_strdup(ui, str)`` —— 将临时字符串拷贝到当前帧内存池中。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:188
msgid ""
"String literals and persistent buffers owned by ``Model`` that outlive "
"the frame can be passed directly to controls."
msgstr "字符串字面量以及由 ``Model`` 持有且生命周期跨帧的缓冲区可直接传给控件。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:193
msgid ""
"In **0.3.3**, ``xtk_text`` inherits font size and weight from its "
"ancestors when ``.size`` is ``0`` or ``.weight`` is ``XTK_FONT_INHERIT`` "
"(root default: 14 px regular). Set ``.size`` and ``.weight`` explicitly "
"on headings."
msgstr ""
"在 **0.3.3** 中，当 ``xtk_text`` 的 ``.size`` 为 ``0`` 或 ``.weight`` 为 ``XTK_FONT_INHERIT`` 时，"
"字号与字重会从祖先节点继承（根节点默认为 14 px 常规字重）。编写标题文本时请显式指定 ``.size`` 与 ``.weight`` 。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:198
msgid "Common Controls and ``XtkMsg`` Payloads"
msgstr "常用控件与 ``XtkMsg`` 消息载荷"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:200
msgid ""
"When a user interacts with a control, the host populates the matching "
