#: ../../source/declarative.rst:231
msgid "Controlled Text Input"
msgstr "受控文本输入"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:233
msgid ""
"Duplicate the borrowed ``msg.ptr`` string inside ``update()`` to store "
"edited text in your ``Model``:"
msgstr "在 ``update()`` 内拷贝借用的 ``msg.ptr`` 字符串，即可将编辑后的文本存入 ``Model`` ："

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:253
msgid ""
"The host tracks ``XtkChangeStamp`` revisions automatically so binding "
"``m->name`` to ``.content`` preserves active IME composition and cursor "
"selection."
msgstr ""
"宿主会自动追踪 ``XtkChangeStamp`` 变更戳，因此将 ``m->name`` 绑定回 ``.content`` 时能够保留正在进行的输入法组字与光标选区。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:258
msgid "Virtualized Lists"
msgstr "虚拟化列表"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:260
msgid ""
"``xtk_list`` virtualizes large collections automatically, realizing rows "
"for the visible viewport on demand:"
msgstr "``xtk_list`` 自动对大数据集做虚拟化，按可见视口按需实例化行元素："

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:288
msgid ""
"In **0.3.3**, ``.itemh = 0`` (the default) measures variable-height rows "
"automatically; set a positive ``.itemh`` (such as ``40``) when all rows "
"share a uniform height."
msgstr ""
"在 **0.3.3** 中，默认的 ``.itemh = 0`` 会自动测量可变行高；当所有行高度固定一致时，可设置正数的 ``.itemh`` （如 ``40`` ）。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:293
msgid "Keys and Memoized Regions"
msgstr "节点键（Key）与缓存区域"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:295
msgid ""
"**Sibling keys**: Wrap dynamically reordered or switched elements in "
"``xtk_keyed_u64(el, id)`` (allocation-free) or ``xtk_keyed(ui, key_str, "
"el)`` so the reconciler matches retained controls by explicit key across "
"updates."
msgstr ""
"**同级节点键** ：对动态重排或切换的元素使用 ``xtk_keyed_u64(el, id)`` （零分配）或 "
"``xtk_keyed(ui, key_str, el)`` 包裹，使协调器在更新时按显式键值匹配保留式控件。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:298
msgid ""
"**Memoized subtrees**: Wrap large unchanging subtrees in "
"``xtk_static_region(ui, region_id, build_fn, ctx)`` (built once) or "
"``xtk_memo_region(ui, region_id, revision, build_fn, ctx)`` (rebuilt when"
" ``revision`` increments)."
msgstr ""
"**缓存子树** ：使用 ``xtk_static_region(ui, region_id, build_fn, ctx)`` （仅构建一次）或 "
"``xtk_memo_region(ui, region_id, revision, build_fn, ctx)`` （在 ``revision`` 递增时重建）包裹大型静态子树。"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:304
msgid "Exploring Every Control"
msgstr "浏览全部控件示例"

#: ../../source/declarative.rst:306
msgid ""
"Every declarative control in ``<xtk/xtk.h>`` has a runnable page in the "
"``fluxent`` repository under ``examples/gallery_decl/pages/``. Clone "
"``fluxent`` and run ``xmake run fluxent_gallery_decl`` to inspect them "
"interactively."
msgstr ""
"``<xtk/xtk.h>`` 中的每一个声明式控件都在 ``fluxent`` 仓库的 ``examples/gallery_decl/pages/`` "
"下配有可运行的示例页。克隆 ``fluxent`` 后执行 ``xmake run fluxent_gallery_decl`` 即可交互式查看全部控件。"
